<code>assert \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < this.size(); this.get(i) == coll.toArray()[i];</code>

This assert statement checks that for every valid index `i` in the range from `0` to `this.size() - 1`, the element at index `i` in the `TreeList` is the same as the element at index `i` in the input collection `coll`. We use `coll.toArray()` to convert the collection to an array for easy element comparison.
--------------------
<code>assert \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < this.size(); this.get(i) == coll.toArray()[i];</code>
